g elements: 2,3,4. Need singletons covering each. For 2: rows1 or6 (2). For 3: row0 (1). For 4: rows5 or7 (2). So ways: 2*1*2=4. Also need to ensure no overlap: doubleton uses 0,1; singles use 2,3,4 distinct. Good.\n\nB2: [3,4] (row4). Remaining elements: 0,1,2. Singles: 0: rows2 or8 (2). 1: row10 (1). 2: rows1 or6 (2). Ways: 2*1*2=4.\n\nB3: [2,3] (row9). Remaining: 0,1,4. Singles: 0: rows2 or8 (2). 1: row10 (1). 4: rows5 or7 (2). Ways: 2*1*2=4.\n\nTotal for case"}}],"created":1790980612,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4185,"total_tokens":4953,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-o5EZAEYkKyi7aonrlNgB6A0UpynQYQoR","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4185,"prompt_ms":532.146,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12715555555555555,"prompt_per_second":7864.383082838169,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2430.552,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.1689074315514993,"predicted_per_second":315.56617591394877}}